{"words": [{"text": "فِى", "translation": "In"}, {"text": "قُلُوبِهِم", "translation": "their hearts"}, {"text": "مَّرَضٌۭ", "translation": "(is) a disease"}, {"text": "فَزَادَهُمُ", "translation": "so has increased them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مَرَضًۭا ۖ", "translation": "(in) disease"}, {"text": "وَلَهُمْ", "translation": "and for them"}, {"text": "عَذَابٌ", "translation": "(is) a punishment"}, {"text": "أَلِيمٌۢ", "translation": "painful"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "because"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "they used to"}, {"text": "يَكْذِبُونَ", "translation": "[they] lie"}], "sahih": "In their hearts is disease, so Allāh has increased their disease;1 and for them is a painful punishment because they [habitually] used to lie."}